WEBVTT

00:09.990 --> 00:11.280
You've finally come!

00:12.070 --> 00:13.610
I apologize for taking so long.

00:13.610 --> 00:15.520
I kind of overdid it a bit,

00:15.520 --> 00:18.280
so I'd like to consult with 
you about my status...

00:18.280 --> 00:21.550
Indeed, your current 
numbers are quite inhuman.

00:21.550 --> 00:22.550
Inhuman?!

00:22.550 --> 00:25.200
Your life experience has yet to catch up,

00:25.200 --> 00:27.290
but even now, you are likely 
the most powerful of humans.

00:27.690 --> 00:29.930
Want to go ahead and become a demigod?

00:29.930 --> 00:31.130
A demigod?

00:31.550 --> 00:34.710
They're in the same class as 
holy beasts and divine dragons.

00:34.710 --> 00:39.930
Though, Cain, you must understand that 
there are limits to what you can do alone.

00:40.310 --> 00:41.910
Don't test those limits.

00:41.910 --> 00:43.100
Uh-huh...

00:43.480 --> 00:47.180
Anyway, there isn't much entertainment 
to be had in this realm.

00:47.180 --> 00:48.860
Could you perhaps...

00:48.860 --> 00:51.730
use your knowledge from your 
previous life to create some?

00:51.730 --> 00:56.730
<i>Entertainment? So if I could bring in 
items that don't exist in this world...</i>

00:56.730 --> 00:58.810
<i>They're guaranteed to be a hit?!</i>

00:58.810 --> 01:00.320
Exactly!

01:01.110 --> 01:03.670
I forgot they could hear my thoughts!

01:03.670 --> 01:04.740
That's right, Cain!

01:04.740 --> 01:06.080
Can you do it?!

01:06.080 --> 01:08.000
Uh, yes!

01:10.090 --> 01:13.650
<i>After all, I'm a reincarnated noble</i>

01:14.090 --> 01:16.260
<i>with memories of my past life 
and off-the-charts status.</i>

01:18.620 --> 01:22.970
<i>But that's a secret to everyone!</i>

01:33.150 --> 01:36.030
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

02:53.540 --> 02:57.880
"Debut in the Royal Capital"

02:53.540 --> 02:57.880
"Debut in the Royal Capital"

02:53.670 --> 02:56.360
<i>Ugh, this is so awkward...</i>

03:00.130 --> 03:01.780
<i>So awkward!</i>

03:01.780 --> 03:03.620
<i>It couldn't be more awkward!</i>

03:04.330 --> 03:07.450
This is not the kind of place 
a boy should be in alone!

03:07.450 --> 03:08.540
Huh?

03:08.780 --> 03:11.620
Those cat ears... Is that... Parma?

03:12.170 --> 03:13.250
Oh! Master Cain!

03:13.470 --> 03:14.670
Master Cain!

03:14.900 --> 03:16.890
Parma! It's been five years!

03:16.890 --> 03:19.520
What are you doing here, Master Cain?

03:19.520 --> 03:21.800
I'm here for my debut ceremony 
in the royal capital.

03:22.140 --> 03:23.190
What about you?

03:23.190 --> 03:27.440
I'm training here at my uncle's shop.

03:27.440 --> 03:29.950
Parma, did one of your friends come by?

03:30.750 --> 03:32.440
What an adorable little boy.

03:32.440 --> 03:36.260
Uncle Tamanis, Master Cain is a noble.

03:36.260 --> 03:38.070
What?! A noble?

03:38.070 --> 03:39.780
Please pardon my rudeness!

03:40.090 --> 03:43.460
Don't worry about it. I wouldn't 
expect people to know.

03:43.460 --> 03:46.450
Anyway, would you mind if 
I took a look in your shop?

03:48.490 --> 03:51.140
Wow, you have all kinds of things.

03:52.350 --> 03:56.000
Tamanis, there's a certain 
recreational item I'd like to make.

03:56.320 --> 03:58.970
R-Recreational?

03:58.970 --> 04:00.860
I already have some ideas.

04:00.860 --> 04:03.790
Would you be willing to produce and sell it?

04:06.190 --> 04:08.470
Oh? Let's see...

04:08.740 --> 04:11.310
It looks simple, yet rather entertaining.

04:11.310 --> 04:13.980
Really? You think so?

04:15.000 --> 04:17.860
Yes, and it's easy to learn how to play.

04:17.860 --> 04:22.280
I think I could offer this at 
a very affordable price. Yes.

04:22.630 --> 04:24.950
Please allow me to produce this!

04:25.230 --> 04:28.970
Great! Could you make a 
prototype of it first?

04:28.970 --> 04:31.160
I'll leave this to cover the expenses.

04:31.160 --> 04:34.120
A g-gold coin?! Th-This is too much!

04:34.120 --> 04:36.460
Think of it as an up-front investment.

04:37.330 --> 04:41.840
All right. I will gratefully accept it, then.

04:41.840 --> 04:46.180
Master Cain, as the head 
of the Saracaen Company,

04:46.690 --> 04:49.140
I will give my all to this project!

04:51.390 --> 04:52.750
I'll see you again soon.

04:56.770 --> 04:59.880
Crap! I forgot about Sister Reine!

04:59.880 --> 05:01.650
S-Sister Reine...

05:01.650 --> 05:05.040
Honestly, Cain! You just disappeared on me!

05:05.040 --> 05:08.470
I wanted you to see how I looked 
in the clothes I tried on!

05:08.470 --> 05:12.790
It's because I know you'll look cute 
no matter what you're wearing.

05:12.790 --> 05:14.570
Oh! Really?

05:14.570 --> 05:15.250
Yes!

05:15.530 --> 05:18.880
In that case, you can take 
your time seeing them at home!

05:19.220 --> 05:21.250
Look forward to it, okay?

05:21.250 --> 05:23.460
O-Okay...

05:23.970 --> 05:25.170
Here you go!

05:26.440 --> 05:27.130
What do you think?

05:28.220 --> 05:29.090
What do you think?

05:29.800 --> 05:31.060
What do you think?

05:34.510 --> 05:37.520
They all look lovely on you, Sister Reine.

05:37.900 --> 05:40.280
Okay, now it's your turn, Cain!

05:40.280 --> 05:41.200
Huh?!

05:41.740 --> 05:42.980
Master Cain.

05:43.420 --> 05:47.370
Mr. Tamanis has asked 
you to come to his shop.

05:49.850 --> 05:51.620
Wow!

05:51.620 --> 05:53.500
It's finished already?

05:54.570 --> 05:59.290
It still needs refining, but I made 
it my top priority to finish it.

06:00.060 --> 06:02.500
How does it look?

06:04.920 --> 06:09.550
It looks great! Exactly like the 
Reversi I pictured in my head!

06:10.260 --> 06:11.010
Reversi?

06:11.280 --> 06:14.470
Yes. Why don't we give it a try first?

06:19.940 --> 06:22.690
And now I've won. That's how this game works.

06:23.080 --> 06:24.610
Master Cain...

06:25.130 --> 06:28.120
This is absolutely going to catch on!

06:28.120 --> 06:32.490
<i>I mean, it's a classic, super-popular 
game that everybody knows...</i>

06:32.770 --> 06:36.310
That was so much fun! I want to play again!

06:36.310 --> 06:38.160
I'm positive this will sell!

06:38.410 --> 06:42.880
Then, when you produce it, make a regular 
version and a separate one for nobles.

06:43.360 --> 06:47.230
I'm sure nobles and wealthy merchants 
will want a fancier product,

06:47.620 --> 06:52.420
and I'd like the regular version 
to be something anyone can afford.

06:52.420 --> 06:53.720
Brilliant!

06:53.720 --> 06:55.610
Let's make fifty of the noble version,

06:55.610 --> 06:58.100
and a thousand of the regular version.

06:58.100 --> 07:01.440
We can make a contract to produce 
more as needed based on sales.

07:02.630 --> 07:03.270
But...

07:04.610 --> 07:08.210
Our company doesn't have 
much in the way of surplus funds.

07:08.210 --> 07:11.560
If we charge one large silver 
coin for the noble version

07:08.210 --> 07:16.660
<b>Noble</b>

07:08.210 --> 07:16.660
Large Silver Coin

07:08.210 --> 07:16.660
<b>Silver</b>

07:08.210 --> 07:16.660
<b>Regular</b>

07:08.210 --> 07:16.660
Silver Coin

07:08.210 --> 07:16.660
<b>Silver</b>

07:11.560 --> 07:14.240
and one silver coin for the regular version,

07:14.240 --> 07:16.660
and assume the production 
costs... let's see...

07:17.430 --> 07:19.080
I've got you covered!

07:19.080 --> 07:20.870
M-Master Cain?!

07:20.870 --> 07:22.260
Is this enough?

07:23.200 --> 07:27.190
The Saracaen Company w-will 
do its utmost best!

07:27.190 --> 07:30.130
Please... There's no need to bow, Mr. Tamanis.

07:30.130 --> 07:33.260
This is just an up-front investment.

07:33.260 --> 07:34.220
Understood!

07:36.100 --> 07:40.410
Let's start by drawing up a contract and 
presenting it to the God of Commerce.

07:40.750 --> 07:47.360
Then, if we swear to the god that we will 
each uphold our end of the contract,

07:47.770 --> 07:51.270
no one will be able to produce 
the same product for three years.

07:51.270 --> 07:52.320
I see.

07:53.020 --> 07:54.450
Let's begin.

07:55.450 --> 07:57.750
We offer this product to the gods.

07:57.750 --> 08:00.840
Acknowledge now, along with our vows, 
that this product belongs to none but us.

08:11.340 --> 08:14.660
And now our contract with 
the god is complete.

08:14.660 --> 08:17.160
This product belongs to us now.

08:17.160 --> 08:19.890
Then let's strive to start 
selling it in one month.

08:19.890 --> 08:24.240
Oh, and could I ask you to prepare 
one more extravagant one?

08:24.240 --> 08:25.730
I'll give it to the royal household.

08:26.030 --> 08:28.330
What?! Th-The royal household?!

08:28.330 --> 08:29.330
Yes.

08:29.330 --> 08:31.570
But a mid-scale company like ours

08:32.170 --> 08:35.290
could never produce anything 
worthy of the royal household!

08:35.290 --> 08:38.330
Don't worry. I know you can do it.

08:38.680 --> 08:42.260
I-I'll do it! With great pleasure!

08:42.260 --> 08:46.170
Anyway, you must have some 
amazing connections, Master Cain.

08:46.170 --> 08:49.650
<i>Yeah, the "amazing" part is 
that it's not just the king.</i>

08:49.650 --> 08:53.020
<i>The fact that the Reversi set disappeared...</i>

08:53.720 --> 08:58.180
<i>must mean the gods are enjoying it 
right now. At least, I hope they are.</i>

09:02.930 --> 09:03.980
I'm home.

09:04.280 --> 09:06.770
What have you been doing, Master Cain?!

09:06.770 --> 09:08.560
The debut ceremony is about to begin!

09:13.050 --> 09:13.940
Cain.

09:15.410 --> 09:18.410
You became a baron during 
that audience with the king.

09:19.130 --> 09:21.990
You'll be drawing a lot of 
attention at your debut today.

09:21.990 --> 09:22.790
I know.

09:22.790 --> 09:26.120
Watch out for parents trying to 
introduce you to their daughters.

09:26.600 --> 09:29.790
Understood. I'll find a 
way to deal with them.

09:30.480 --> 09:33.960
You don't sound like a ten-year-old at all...

09:40.210 --> 09:41.950
I'm a bit nervous.

09:41.950 --> 09:44.050
Be on your highest guard.

09:44.050 --> 09:44.860
Right.

09:51.840 --> 09:53.050
<i>Be on my guard...</i>

09:55.180 --> 09:56.470
<i>Be on my guard...</i>

10:17.360 --> 10:19.170
<i>He looks nasty.</i>

10:20.590 --> 10:23.310
<i>Is that his son and his followers?</i>

10:23.700 --> 10:24.890
Cain.

10:31.980 --> 10:34.320
<i>That smile is scaring me, though!</i>

10:34.790 --> 10:39.560
Duke Eric, thank you again for 
your generosity last time.

10:39.560 --> 10:42.390
Allow me to introduce my third son, Cain.

10:42.390 --> 10:45.410
<i>Oh, right. The baron thing 
was declared in private,</i>

10:45.410 --> 10:48.000
<i>so this is the first time it's 
being discussed in public.</i>

10:48.240 --> 10:51.460
Ah, so you are Margrave Garm's son.

10:51.790 --> 10:54.250
Yes. I am Cain von Silford.

10:54.720 --> 10:56.090
It's a pleasure to meet you.

10:56.490 --> 11:00.180
Well, well! If it isn't the 
great hero, Baron Cain.

11:00.410 --> 11:01.910
Thank you for...

11:01.910 --> 11:04.350
<i>Again, that smile is scaring me!</i>

11:05.180 --> 11:08.860
...saving my beloved Silk the other day.

11:08.860 --> 11:11.560
I hope we will have a favorable relationship.

11:12.290 --> 11:13.110
Master Cain.

11:13.520 --> 11:15.820
It is an honor to see you.

11:16.840 --> 11:19.180
I am Silk von Santana.

11:19.180 --> 11:23.780
Thank you for saving me when I was in danger.

11:24.020 --> 11:26.490
I hope we will have a favorable relationship.

11:26.490 --> 11:28.540
M-Miss Silk!

11:28.540 --> 11:30.800
You look beautiful in that dress!

11:30.800 --> 11:33.210
So lovely that you could 
be mistaken for a princess!

11:34.210 --> 11:37.300
R-Really? Do you really think it suits me?

11:37.850 --> 11:39.700
It suits you very well!

11:39.700 --> 11:41.100
<i>Master Cain!</i>

11:41.100 --> 11:42.330
<i>Silk!</i>

11:42.330 --> 11:44.120
<i>Master Cain!</i>

11:46.930 --> 11:51.640
I do believe Master Cain is a bit too 
skilled with the ladies for a ten-year-old.

11:51.640 --> 11:54.840
Goodness! His sister Reine is 
just such a tomboy, you see.

11:54.840 --> 11:58.710
She can get very upset if one isn't careful,
and he has grown used to that.

11:58.710 --> 12:00.040
I see.

12:03.310 --> 12:04.410
Goodbye, then.

12:04.970 --> 12:07.120
You don't act ten years old at all.

12:07.610 --> 12:11.780
I kind of ended up talking to her 
like I would to Sister Reine.

12:11.780 --> 12:16.160
Giving Sister Reine compliments always 
puts her in such high spirits.

12:17.270 --> 12:18.480
I apologize.

12:30.390 --> 12:35.310
Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for 
traveling so far to join us today.

12:35.810 --> 12:38.450
I hope all of you who are 
turning ten this year

12:36.510 --> 12:37.530
<i>Teles!</i>

12:38.450 --> 12:42.520
will put in your best efforts 
to move this kingdom forward.

12:43.970 --> 12:44.960
Cheers!

12:45.960 --> 12:47.660
Cheers!

12:50.660 --> 12:51.660
Your Majesty.

12:52.180 --> 12:55.570
Thank you for inviting us here today.

12:55.570 --> 12:59.130
Cain, greet Princess Telestia, as well.

12:59.130 --> 13:00.130
Of course.

13:00.370 --> 13:04.730
Princess Telestia, you look 
as beautiful as ever today.

13:04.730 --> 13:06.550
I thought a goddess had appeared before me,

13:06.550 --> 13:10.100
and I was so overcome that 
I even forgot to breathe.

13:11.560 --> 13:16.040
Garm, how did you raise your child 
to be such a philanderer?

13:16.040 --> 13:17.520
Just look at Teles!

13:18.690 --> 13:22.400
A goddess... Master Cain 
called me a goddess...

13:22.680 --> 13:24.990
Master Cain called me...

13:25.340 --> 13:28.480
a goddess!

13:27.550 --> 13:28.480
Cain!

13:28.480 --> 13:30.950
The king's smile is kind of scary, too!

13:31.180 --> 13:36.330
U-Um... I brought something today 
that I would like to present to you.

13:36.330 --> 13:39.340
May I take it out of my Item Box?

13:40.030 --> 13:41.780
Very well, philanderer.

13:43.370 --> 13:44.740
What is this?

13:44.740 --> 13:47.980
A game that I developed in cooperation 
with the Saracaen Company.

13:47.980 --> 13:49.510
It's called Reversi.

13:49.780 --> 13:52.230
Reversi? That sounds entertaining.

13:52.780 --> 13:54.980
I'd like to hear more about it later.

13:55.470 --> 14:00.370
I need to talk to you about your 
treatment of my daughter, as well.

14:00.370 --> 14:03.900
Come to the parlor after 
the ceremony. Understand?

14:03.900 --> 14:05.810
I certainly do.

14:08.660 --> 14:13.730
Cain, you were involved in the production 
of a game without my knowledge?

14:13.730 --> 14:16.060
Yes. After being named a baron,

14:16.060 --> 14:19.370
I feared I might not have enough money 
to maintain the mansion I was given.

14:20.190 --> 14:24.910
I understand. You are a full-fledged 
noble with a peerage now.

14:24.910 --> 14:27.550
It's up to you to take 
responsibility for your own life.

14:28.020 --> 14:30.730
I need to go back and make my rounds.

14:30.730 --> 14:34.290
Try talking just with other children 
for a change, as a child would.

14:34.290 --> 14:36.250
<i>As a child would, huh?</i>

14:36.250 --> 14:39.540
<i>I guess becoming a baron and 
getting involved in commerce</i>

14:39.540 --> 14:41.670
<i>is a bit much for a ten-year-old.</i>

14:41.670 --> 14:44.570
Hello, Master Cain! Are you by yourself?

14:45.530 --> 14:47.670
Teles is still with the king,

14:47.670 --> 14:49.240
so why don't we talk for a while?

14:50.000 --> 14:51.020
Thank you.

14:51.930 --> 14:53.610
Isn't this amazing?

14:53.610 --> 14:56.320
There are so many more 
people than I expected.

14:56.320 --> 15:00.240
I couldn't spend all my 
time talking to Teles,

15:00.240 --> 15:02.290
so I'm glad I found you, Master Cain.

15:04.300 --> 15:08.050
Silk, please stop calling me "Master Cain."

15:08.050 --> 15:10.830
Hm? Should I call you "Cain," then?

15:10.830 --> 15:13.850
Or would you prefer "Baron Cain"?

15:14.080 --> 15:16.640
No, no. Just "Cain," please.

15:16.640 --> 15:18.560
In that case...

15:18.920 --> 15:22.520
Cain! Cain! Cain!

15:22.520 --> 15:25.980
Wait... You don't have to 
say it over and over...

15:23.820 --> 15:25.980
Cain!

15:29.300 --> 15:31.760
Well, if it isn't Miss Silk!

15:31.760 --> 15:35.240
Greetings to you. What a 
lovely dress you're wearing.

15:36.520 --> 15:39.450
Squee! Master Habit! Greetings to you!

15:39.970 --> 15:41.670
That's what she's gonna do!

15:44.130 --> 15:46.540
<i>Whoa, talk about ice-cold!</i>

15:46.830 --> 15:48.620
Hey, you!

15:48.620 --> 15:53.530
Master Habit, the eldest son of the 
Marquis of Corgino, is talking to Miss Silk!

15:53.530 --> 15:54.220
Butt out!

15:54.220 --> 15:56.180
Yep, he's Corgino's son.

15:56.510 --> 15:59.300
Don't you even know how to greet people?

15:59.300 --> 16:03.480
Oh... Good evening, Habit. 
It's a pleasure to meet you.

16:04.040 --> 16:05.230
I am Baron Cain.

16:05.450 --> 16:10.490
Hey! Where does a measly baron's son get 
off addressing Master Habit that way?!

16:10.490 --> 16:12.400
Address him with "Master"!

16:12.730 --> 16:15.420
Yeah! And we're the sons of viscounts!

16:15.420 --> 16:17.370
Use "Master" when you talk to us, too!

16:17.370 --> 16:19.090
Wait just a minute, you two.

16:19.090 --> 16:20.000
Yes, sir!

16:20.000 --> 16:23.770
This rude Cain boy must come 
from such a poor barony

16:23.770 --> 16:26.440
that he can't even give his last name.

16:26.440 --> 16:29.850
If you apologize now, 
I'll hold these two back.

16:29.850 --> 16:32.690
I can see that Miss Silk is worried, too.

16:32.690 --> 16:35.510
Hey! What's that supposed to mean?

16:35.510 --> 16:38.720
It's all right. Habit will be 
the one to apologize first.

16:39.180 --> 16:40.750
What do you mean by that?!

16:40.750 --> 16:43.150
Miss Silk is clearly upset.

16:43.150 --> 16:45.060
Perhaps you are the rude one?

16:45.540 --> 16:47.580
You're nothing but a destitute baron!

16:47.580 --> 16:50.400
If you refuse to apologize...

16:50.850 --> 16:54.320
There are too many people 
in here! Step outside!

16:54.650 --> 16:57.600
<i>Uh-oh. Did I take that a bit too far?</i>

17:00.410 --> 17:02.570
Cain, what are you going to do?

17:02.570 --> 17:05.310
I told you that you didn't 
need to come with me.

17:05.310 --> 17:07.920
But I'm just so worried about you!

17:07.920 --> 17:09.420
I'll be fine, really!

17:09.420 --> 17:11.120
But, Cain...

17:11.120 --> 17:12.130
Hey, you!

17:12.410 --> 17:16.430
Quit your flirting and look at me! 
Listen when I'm speaking!

17:16.830 --> 17:19.020
These two have the gods' protection,

17:19.020 --> 17:20.810
and they can use magic!

17:20.810 --> 17:22.000
I bet you—

17:22.000 --> 17:24.770
Oh, Cain! I'm scared!

17:25.110 --> 17:27.250
Hey! Get away from her!

17:27.560 --> 17:30.820
You're about to witness a legend!

17:30.820 --> 17:33.400
Wait, how do I do that again? Like this?

17:33.900 --> 17:35.990
The way he's so hesitant 
is just scaring me more!

17:35.990 --> 17:36.950
Here I go!

17:38.620 --> 17:42.430
Magic of mine, open and strengthen!

17:42.430 --> 17:46.660
All right! More and more 
magic is gathering to me!

17:46.660 --> 17:50.790
Appear here now, reveal in 
darkness, amplify the light...

17:54.760 --> 17:58.050
and burn with the glow of dawn!

17:58.050 --> 17:59.720
Great Magic:

17:58.510 --> 17:59.720
<b>Great Magic:</b>

17:59.720 --> 18:02.410
Fire Ball!

18:06.270 --> 18:07.210
Weak.

18:07.210 --> 18:07.980
Tiny.

18:08.220 --> 18:10.410
What?! Okay, it's my turn!

18:10.410 --> 18:12.330
I'll get you with my earth magic!

18:12.710 --> 18:13.820
Let me see that.

18:16.490 --> 18:19.990
Magic of mine, open and strengthen!

18:20.600 --> 18:23.690
All right! More and more 
magic is gathering to me!

18:23.690 --> 18:28.290
Appear here now, reveal in 
darkness, amplify the light...

18:29.740 --> 18:32.500
Turn heaven to earth, and earth to soil!

18:32.340 --> 18:33.550
<b>Great Magic:</b>

18:32.500 --> 18:33.840
Great Magic:

18:33.840 --> 18:36.750
Rock Bullet!

18:38.130 --> 18:39.510
Zoom.

18:39.510 --> 18:42.890
In that case... Magic of mine, grow—

18:43.210 --> 18:46.040
How long are you going to keep this up?!

18:46.040 --> 18:48.200
Enough of this senseless squabbling!

18:48.200 --> 18:50.660
I don't know how you got so confused,

18:50.660 --> 18:53.310
but Cain is not the son of a baron!

18:53.310 --> 18:55.280
He <i>is</i> a baron!

18:56.790 --> 19:02.280
Don't you know him? He's the third 
son of Margrave Garm von Silford!

19:02.630 --> 19:04.990
I'm Baron Cain von Silford.

19:04.990 --> 19:06.560
What?!

19:06.560 --> 19:15.500
He saved Princess Telestia and me 
from an army of thirty orcs all by himself!

19:15.900 --> 19:18.210
I'm Baron Cain von Silford.

19:18.610 --> 19:22.540
I-I did hear of a kid who annihilated 
an army led by an orc general...

19:22.540 --> 19:25.490
...and was granted a peerage, 
even though he's our age!

19:25.490 --> 19:27.060
And that kid was...

19:27.290 --> 19:29.770
Baron Cain von Silford!

19:31.490 --> 19:32.980
You should be bowing!

19:33.440 --> 19:35.700
R-Right!

19:35.700 --> 19:37.260
Please forgive us!

19:37.260 --> 19:40.150
I didn't realize you were a baron 
and said all those rude things!

19:40.150 --> 19:41.820
It's nice to meet you.

19:41.820 --> 19:45.780
Y-Yes, sir! We're very sorry!

19:49.470 --> 19:51.690
Did you see the looks on their faces?

19:51.690 --> 19:55.250
Cain, you knew they were 
mistaken, didn't you?

19:55.250 --> 19:58.550
You have a surprising dark side to you.

19:58.550 --> 20:01.160
I'll have to tell Teles about that!

20:01.160 --> 20:03.150
Uh, no, please don't...

20:04.730 --> 20:07.760
If you'll go on a date with me,
 I'll keep your secret.

20:08.130 --> 20:10.980
What are you keeping a secret?

20:11.740 --> 20:12.440
Teles!

20:12.950 --> 20:14.060
Just now—

20:14.870 --> 20:19.900
Master Cain, touching an 
unmarried lady's lips is scandalous!

20:20.270 --> 20:23.240
I'll have to inform Duke Eric of this!

20:23.470 --> 20:24.280
What?!

20:24.280 --> 20:26.260
Tell me the truth!

20:26.260 --> 20:28.450
Silk, what happened?

20:28.450 --> 20:30.950
N-Nothing happened! Really!

20:30.950 --> 20:34.290
We were just saying that Cain and 
I would go on a date sometime.

20:34.580 --> 20:38.190
What? You and Master Cain... 
on a d-d-date?!

20:38.190 --> 20:41.420
Also, you've stopped calling 
him "Master" all of a sudden!

20:41.840 --> 20:44.590
Th-There are a few reasons for that...

20:45.980 --> 20:50.030
I'm jealous! I want a date 
with Master Cain, too!

20:51.590 --> 20:54.560
That's so cute. Her cheeks 
look like sweet buns.

20:56.270 --> 20:57.750
All right.

20:57.750 --> 21:00.020
Let's go on a date sometime, Teles.

21:01.910 --> 21:03.980
Where did you say you're going?

21:04.410 --> 21:07.200
On a date with Master Cain, of course!

21:08.910 --> 21:12.210
Cain, your game isn't all 
we need to talk about.

21:12.210 --> 21:16.180
It appears we need to have a nice, 
long chat about Teles, as well...

21:16.180 --> 21:17.380
Man to man...

21:17.750 --> 21:20.130
To our hearts' content!

21:20.770 --> 21:23.240
He's gonna chew me out again!

21:23.240 --> 21:24.390
Cain!

21:24.390 --> 21:25.780
Master Cain!

21:26.090 --> 21:27.830
Cain!

21:27.830 --> 21:29.830
Yes, sire!

23:02.480 --> 23:04.350
This is quite amusing.

23:04.830 --> 23:07.440
I'd like to keep it a secret 
between just you and me.

23:07.720 --> 23:13.110
No, I think we should share this 
entertainment with everyone in the kingdom.

23:13.110 --> 23:18.040
Speaking of, I hear you've 
arranged for a date with my Silk.

23:18.040 --> 23:23.360
The engagement is settled, but our 
plans are still a secret, so...

23:23.360 --> 23:24.840
be very careful.

23:24.840 --> 23:29.050
Indeed. Don't let anyone 
else find out. Right?

23:29.050 --> 23:31.010
You philanderer.

23:32.200 --> 23:33.950
<i>They're really strong...</i>

23:35.050 --> 23:36.530
<b>Preview</b>

23:35.640 --> 23:38.140
Next time, "Welcome to My 
Off-the-Charts Mansion."

23:36.930 --> 23:40.270
<b>"Welcome to My Off-the-Charts Mansion"</b>

23:38.140 --> 23:40.020
{missing}
